PASS an+1 maps (a = 3,5,7,11,13,17,1093,3511; odd n < 2e5): (an+1)/2^v = omega(2)^(-v) (1+a)^(n + q_a(2) v) (mod a^2); each halving turns the mu_(a-1) clock by omega(2)^(-1) and the 1+aZ clock by the Fermat quotient q_a(2), frozen iff a is Wieferich
   (a, q_a(2) mod a): [(3, 1), (5, 3), (7, 2), (11, 5), (13, 3), (17, 13), (1093, 0), (3511, 0)]
